{"seq":4,"slug":"tourism-marketing-economy","title":"Tourism Marketing Economy","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tourism-marketing","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游市场营销","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy/tourism-marketing","wordCount":1734,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"tourism-economics-impact","title":"大学旅游管理 — 旅游经济与影响","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy/tourism-economics-impact","wordCount":1801,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-tourism-digital","title":"大学旅游管理 — 智慧旅游与数字化转型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/tourism-mgmt/tourism-marketing-economy/smart-tourism-digital","wordCount":1789,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"tourism-marketing-economy-简介\">Tourism Marketing Economy 简介</h1><p>本章把旅游市场的营销动作与经济分析合在一起。先讲旅游产品如何定位、定价、触达客群的营销方法，再从旅游经济学角度分析旅游消费对目的地的乘数效应与收入漏损，最后引入智慧旅游与数字化，说明数据平台如何改变营销与体验交付。三篇文档构成「怎么把游客引来 — 引来之后产生什么经济影响 — 数字化如何重塑这两件事」的完整链条。</p>\n"}